                                    <h2>FAQs</h2>
<h3>Do I need a Mumbai-based marketing agency for my Mumbai D2C brand?</h3>
<p>Not necessarily. <strong>Category expertise + senior practitioner bench matter more than location.</strong> A Bangalore / Delhi agency with deep jewellery D2C experience will outperform a Mumbai agency without it. Location matters only when frequent in-person creative production access matters (jewellery shoots, fashion lookbooks).</p>
<h3>How much does a Mumbai D2C marketing agency cost in 2026?</h3>
<p>Retainers: <strong>&#8377;1.5L&ndash;&#8377;3L/month for growth-stage</strong>, &#8377;3L&ndash;&#8377;6L for scale. Ad spend additional. Mumbai retainers are typically similar to pan-India ranges, despite the cost-of-living premium &mdash; because the talent pool is large.</p>
<h3>What ROAS should a Mumbai D2C brand expect?</h3>
<p>Depends on category. <strong>Jewellery + electronics</strong>: 4&times;&ndash;7&times; blended. <strong>Fashion + beauty</strong>: 2.5&times;&ndash;4&times;. <strong>F&amp;B + subscription</strong>: 4&times;&ndash;6&times; (true MER 6&times;&ndash;9&times; with subscription play).</p>
<h3>What categories do Mumbai D2C agencies specialise in?</h3>
<p>Mumbai&rsquo;s industry concentration favours: jewellery (Andheri / BKC), fashion (Bandra / Lower Parel), beauty (Worli / Powai), financial services, hospitality. Agencies near these clusters often have deeper category networks.</p>
<h3>Do you work with Mumbai jewellery / fashion / beauty brands?</h3>
<p>Yes &mdash; especially. We&rsquo;ve scaled multiple Mumbai-based jewellery, fashion + beauty D2C brands. Our team includes Mumbai-based creative practitioners + we visit Mumbai for shoots + quarterly strategy when relevant.</p>
<h3>How long is a typical Mumbai D2C engagement?</h3>
<p>Average 22 months across our 100+ portfolio. First 90 days is dial-in (audit + creative inventory + tracking + lifecycle). Month 4 onward is scale + optimise.</p>


